  "sentences": [
    {
      "text": "This map says Greenland is as big as Africa.",
      "t0": 0.08,
      "t1": 2.341,
      "speaker": "narrator"
    },
    {
      "text": "It's not even as big as Algeria.",
      "t0": 2.457,
      "t1": 4.222,
      "speaker": "narrator"
    },
    {
      "text": "Excuse me?",
      "t0": 4.442,
      "t1": 5.022,
      "speaker": "greenland",
      "gag": "excuse"
    },
    {
      "text": "Here's the trick.",
      "t0": 5.322,
      "t1": 6.018,
      "speaker": "narrator"
    },
    {
      "text": "To flatten a round Earth, this map stretches land more and more toward the poles.",
      "t0": 6.401,
      "t1": 10.36,
      "speaker": "narrator"
    },
    {
      "text": "Up where Greenland sits, that's about SIXTEEN times too big.",
      "t0": 10.883,
      "t1": 14.087,
      "speaker": "narrator"
    },
    {
      "text": "So let's drag Greenland down to the equator, where the map tells the truth...",
      "t0": 14.691,
      "t1": 17.919,
      "speaker": "narrator"
    },
    {
      "text": "Watch it shrink.",
      "t0": 18.07,
      "t1": 18.789,
      "speaker": "narrator"
    },
    {
      "text": "And shrink.",
      "t0": 19.172,
      "t1": 19.765,
      "speaker": "narrator"
    },
    {
      "text": "And SHRINK.",
      "t0": 19.95,
      "t1": 20.763,
      "speaker": "narrator"
    },
    {
      "text": "Wait... what?!",
      "t0": 21.013,
      "t1": 21.803,
      "speaker": "greenland",
      "gag": "waitwhat"
    },
    {
      "text": "Now drop it on Africa.",
      "t0": 22.303,
      "t1": 23.244,
      "speaker": "narrator"
    },
    {
      "text": "Africa is FOURTEEN times bigger.",
      "t0": 23.864,
      "t1": 25.397,
      "speaker": "narrator"
    },
    {
      "text": "Even Algeria is bigger than Greenland.",
      "t0": 25.919,
      "t1": 27.521,
      "speaker": "narrator"
    },
    {
      "text": "So is D.R.",
      "t0": 28.101,
      "t1": 28.601,
      "speaker": "narrator"
    },
    {
      "text": "Congo.",
      "t0": 28.624,
      "t1": 29.065,
      "speaker": "narrator"
    },
    {
      "text": "Hi, tiny.",
      "t0": 29.245,
      "t1": 29.8,
      "speaker": "algeria",
      "gag": "hitiny"
    },
    {
      "text": "In fact, put the USA, China, India, and all of Europe outside Russia together...",
      "t0": 30.16,
      "t1": 33.933,
      "speaker": "narrator"
    },
    {
      "text": "and Africa is STILL bigger.",
      "t0": 34.27,
      "t1": 35.361,
      "speaker": "narrator"
    },
    {
      "text": "With room to spare.",
      "t0": 35.861,
      "t1": 36.755,
      "speaker": "narrator"
    },
    {
      "text": "So next time someone shows you this map...",
      "t0": 37.278,
      "t1": 38.845,
      "speaker": "narrator"
    },
    {
      "text": "remember: Greenland isn't huge.",
      "t0": 39.286,
      "t1": 41.148,
      "speaker": "narrator"
    },
    {
      "text": "The map is lying.",
      "t0": 41.531,
      "t1": 42.211,
      "speaker": "narrator"
    }
  ],
